## How to reproduce

1. Clone this repository
2. Open RStudio and open the project
3. Run in Console: renv::restore()
4. Run in Console: source("run_all.R")

## Data sources
All data is downloaded automatically from CBS via the cbsodataR package.
No manual downloads needed.

- quintile_income: CBS datasets 83220NED (2015) through 85039NED (2021)
- median_income: CBS dataset 85064NED
- renter_households: CBS dataset 82550NED

